# --- Prioritaet 3: GAVO-TAP (271 Tabellen) ---

candidate https://dc.g-vo.org/tap/sync?REQUEST=doQuery&LANG=ADQL&FORMAT=csv&QUERY=SELECT+TOP+3000+raj2000,dej2000,rv,teff_k,Jmag,parallax+FROM+rave.main+WHERE+parallax+IS+NOT+NULL
note RAVE DR5 (Sternspektroskopie-Survey, dc.g-vo.org). ra/dec + rv (Radialgeschwindigkeit km/s, Doppler = em) + teff_k (K, thermal) + Jmag (em mag) + parallax (mas -> Distanz). Roh-Messwert-Katalog. rv = radvel-Key (Bewegung), teff/Jmag = Feldwerte. Nicht im Register. (RAVE DR4 liegt bei gavo.aip.de als ravedr4.rave_dr4.)
disposition accepted
url https://dc.g-vo.org/tap/sync?REQUEST=doQuery&LANG=ADQL&FORMAT=csv&QUERY=SELECT+TOP+3000+raj2000,dej2000,rv,teff_k,Jmag,parallax+FROM+rave.main+WHERE+parallax+IS+NOT+NULL
ttl 604800
at sun
cmap .
ra raj2000
dec dej2000
plx parallax
radvel rv
flux_from_mag Jmag
field teff_k rave_teff_k gaussian-inverse-square thermal K 604800 0.0 0.0
field Jmag rave_jmag gaussian-inverse-square em mag 604800 0.0 0.0

